   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s035-u014",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "மனோ",
    "text": "I shall go and return. [To the soldiers who have come to arrest Padmavathi] Beware! Until I return, you must not go near my mother...\n[To Vijaya]\nVijaya! Take care of her... I am going.",
